  backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 24d9cd8900e106747ae94f55b3e6e59b, type: 3}
  loadingText: 'SOLORAX [Sector 0]

    Mighty Solorax. This is where we source
    our power from, our successful crusades wouldn''t be possible without these solar
    batteries. They collect and store raw solar energy, but all our successful crusades
    are draining our resources. Which is why we need you to collect and deliver some
    more. You heard they''re unstable? Yeah, they''re practically like bombs - but
    worse. Just don''t be an idiot and fly too fast if you''re carrying one.'
  holdTime: 2
  requireContinueButton: 1
